   "id": "1",
   "label": "獣・動物",
   "label_en": "beast / animal",
   "def": "野獣・動物・毒蛇など、人間以外の生き物を指す一般的な用法。",
   "def_en": "A general use for wild animals, other creatures, venomous snakes, and other living things other than humans.",
   "note": "マコ1:13、使11:6、使28:4-5、ヘブ12:20、ヤコ3:7、黙6:8、黙18:2。"
  },
  {
   "id": "2",
   "label": "獣（黙示録の「獣」）",
   "label_en": "beast (the \"beast\" of Revelation)",
   "def": "黙示録で、海・地から上る権力的な存在として描かれる「獣」。礼拝・印・像と結びつけて語られる。",
   "def_en": "In Revelation, the \"beast\" portrayed as a powerful being rising from the sea or the earth; spoken of in connection with worship, the mark, and the image.",
   "note": "黙11:7、黙13:1-18、黙14:9-11、黙16:2・13、黙17:3-17、黙19:19-20、黙20:4・10。"
  },
  {
   "id": "3",
   "label": "獣（人についての比喩）",
   "label_en": "beast (figurative for people)",
   "def": "人を「獣」にたとえる比喩的用法。",
   "def_en": "A figurative use comparing people to \"beasts\".",
   "note": "テト1:12（κακὰ θηρία）。"
  }
